  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0000" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0002" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">長素</persName>，早惠。年五六歲，讀論語至「周監於二代」，外祖<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0027" ref="d84_kqu_2g5">何尚之</persName>戲之曰：「可改耶耶乎文哉。」<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0044" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>應聲答曰：「尊者之名，安可戲，寧可道草翁之風必舅？」及長，篤志好學。位秘書丞。先<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0085" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">景文</persName>卒，諡曰恭世子。<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0095" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_A">絢</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangxuan:p001:m0097" ref="1tc_q18_x7v_B">繢</persName>。</p>
</text>
